# Cuckoo CUDA test project

This repository contains a minimal CUDA project that implements `siphash24`, `sipnode`, `sipedge` and a kernel that generates edges (u,v) from nonces. Use it to verify GPU outputs against your Java `siphash24` implementation.

---

